  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Stack dependency groups",
      "items": [
        "Network: vpc -> nat -> eks. Core also includes s3, ecr, event-encryption -> sqs -> eventbridge.",
        "Secrets/auth: api-gateway-authorizer-secrets -> authorizer; runtime-secrets also depends on eks. iam depends on eks and messaging.",
        "apigateway-core -> management -> rds; private-cd depends on management/s3/ecr; observability depends on eks/API/RDS.",
        "apigateway-integration waits for a healthy LBC-created ALB. See the full 18-stack DAG in the IaC guide."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Reconstruction is phased",
      "items": [
        "Bootstrap applies 15 core stacks. Platform phases install controllers/ESO, initialize secrets and bootstrap DB roles.",
        "Observability is applied when its addon is absent; private-cd is a separate operator apply. API integration follows ALB readiness.",
        "This is not an unattended fresh-account installer. New resource IDs require reviewed identity/boundary bindings."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Safe removal, not simple reverse apply",
      "items": [
        "Freeze delivery/writers and export evidence before mutating teardown. Exact inventory, plan hash, approvals and journal guards remain required.",
        "Remove Ingress/ALB while LBC exists, prepare RDS deliberately, then retire private access/EKS/network. Backend is last and optional.",
        "Two teardowns were observed. Final completion: 14 October 2026, 11:28 Costa Rica (UTC-06:00)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Historical evidence boundary",
      "items": [
        "190 counts Terraform-managed resources, not all controller-created objects. Three Ready nodes had encrypted root volumes.",
        "Pod egress passed in B/C only; bounded tests establish no SLA. No AWS calls are needed to explore these diagrams.",
        "Final report retained S3/DynamoDB state backend and recorded two KMS keys pending deletion. AWS delivery workflows remain disabled."
      ]
    }
  ],
